<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:24px; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:700; color:#111110;">You’re subscribed to <%= @username %></h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#3D3D3A;">New posts <strong style="color:#111110;"><%= @username %></strong> chooses to share will land in this inbox.</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#3D3D3A;">Changed your mind? Unsubscribe any time:</p>

<p style="margin:24px 0 0;">
  <a href="<%= cancel_subscription_url(@username, @token) %>" style="display:inline-block; background:#111110; color:#F3F3F1; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:12px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">Unsubscribe</a>
</p>
